#
# CVE-2026-69247 (cryptography, HIGH): fixed upstream in cryptography>=50.0.0,
# but mlflow==3.15.2 (the latest release as of this writing) pins
# `cryptography<50,>=43.0.0`, so pip's resolver cannot install a patched
# version without breaking mlflow. Not exploitable via this service's actual
# attack surface (this app never parses untrusted certificates/keys - the
# affected code path). Accepted risk until mlflow relaxes its constraint;
# re-check on every mlflow bump.
CVE-2026-69247
